<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Italian strings. Added by the Kotlin port on 2026-09-25; notes_tech 2.0.9 ships English and
  French only, so these are written here, not generated from its ARB files.

  Same names, same order, same arguments as `values/strings.xml`: LanguesDeLApplicationTest fails on a
  missing or extra name, a different argument, or a missing plural form ("many" included: CLDR's form
  for a million, "1 000 000 di note"). Formal address (Lei), as in SMS Tech; vocabulary shared with
  SMS Tech and Pass Tech (cassaforte, passphrase, modalità panico). Every apostrophe is escaped.
-->
